        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": true,
          "items": [
            "**Regret or criticism**: something was needed and didn't happen. *Daha erken gelmeliydin.* (You should have come earlier.) *Bunu söylememeliydim.* (I shouldn't have said that.)",
            "**A past obligation or arrangement**: *Saat beşte orada olmalıydım.* (I was supposed to be there at five.) Whether you were there depends on the story."
